<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Our own synthetic EEP-shaped environment (not grid content): three identical sky keyframes with a thick haze and the sun a few degrees above the horizon at its stock (not yet dimmed) colour, one water frame, and a probe ambiance, so a sky near dusk takes the tone-mapped path. -->
